   "id": "d0289817",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# PEDS Section B · rater agreement\n",
    "\n",
    "Reads the team Google Sheet and measures how well ratings agree, item by item, for three comparisons:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Comparison | What is paired |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| **Street View: rater vs rater** | Two raters' Street View ratings of the same segment |\n",
    "| **Field: rater vs rater** | Two raters' field ratings of the same segment (same walk or a later visit) |\n",
    "| **Field vs Street View** | Each field rating against each Street View rating of the same segment |\n",
    "\n",
    "For each PEDS item it reports % agreement, Cohen's kappa, Gwet's AC1, and for the ordered items, weighted kappa and agreement within one category. Each estimate has a 95% bootstrap interval that resamples segments.\n",
    "\n",
    "**To run:** set `AREA` in the next cell, then *Run All*. The sheet has to stay shared as \"Anyone with the link can view\". Without internet, download each tab as CSV and set `CSV_DIR`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Data still coming in is fine. Segments without a pair are listed in section 3 and left out of the statistics until both ratings exist."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "df2eab52",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-11-20T16:36:05.861234Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-11-20T16:36:05.861105Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-11-20T16:36:06.212433Z",
